  "description": {
    "short": "TESTING ONLY - not for general use.",
    "full": "RESTRICTED - FOR TESTING PURPOSES ONLY, NOT FOR GENERAL USE. SimBoard Teams bot: detects @mentions in a Teams message (1:1 chat, group chat, or channel), extracts a task description via LLM, resolves the mentioned assignee and message sender against SimBoard's user directory, and creates a SimBoard card. This app package, its permissions, and its bot registration are for internal testing and evaluation only."
  },
